evidence_notes = "A3 supports the Vortex name and troop-transport role only. B4 corroborates a label string only, not a Vortex model. Historical geometry, scale, capacity, access, systems and handling remain UNKNOWN. This owner-approved original modern candidate uses a broad chamfered cabin pod, two side engine housings and recessed stern. All geometry, dimensions, materials and mechanics are modern design choices, not authenticated reconstruction. Card 1 standalone hull/helm flight only: physical access, four passenger chairs, berth/Main registration, weapon installation, recovery and network qualification remain pending. No cargo or specialist roles are fitted."
compatibility_tags = PackedStringArray("medium_craft", "troop_transport", "vortex_transport")
